## Development

```bash
uv sync                      # install deps
uv run pre-commit install    # hooks (commit + pre-push)
uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format .
uv run ty check
uv run pytest
```

Pre-commit runs ruff + hygiene checks; pre-push runs `ty` and `pytest`.

